OL,3,GNEWSAThree-month-old girl died in
OL,4,Awoods, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say they are continuing
OL,7,Finquiries after the unexplained death
OL,8,Fof a three-month-old girl in a woodland
OL,9,Fin Staffordshire.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to land
OL,12,Foff Strawberry Lane, near Cheslyn Hay,
OL,13,Fat 08:45 BST on Saturday, to a report
OL,14,Fof a child in cardiac arrest.
OL,16,FAn air ambulance was sent to the scene,
OL,17,Fbut the child was pronounced dead by
OL,18,Fparamedics a short time later,
OL,19,FStaffordshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
