OL,3,GNEWSAThree-month-old girl died in
OL,4,Awoods, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,F"While the investigation remains at an
OL,7,Fearly stage, this is an isolated
OL,8,Fincident and we understand that the
OL,9,Fchild's family was camping in the
OL,10,Farea," Det Insp Katie Gregory said.
OL,11,F"The death is being treated as
OL,12,Funexplained at this time."
